1
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:09,230
♪La la la la la la, la la la la la la♪

2
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,740
♪La la la la la la la la la♪

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:16,329
♪No matter what day it is,
I'll spend it with you♪

4
00:00:16,329 --> 00:00:19,100
♪We're more sure
of each other than ever♪

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,060
=Watching Heart Signal with You=

6
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:23,580
(Before the watch-along starts)

7
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:28,740
(Leaning close)

8
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,480
Is my face really this round?

9
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:31,640
Your face isn't round at all.

10
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,280
Really?

11
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:32,960
Not round at all.

12
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:33,760
It's super round.

13
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,040
What am I gonna do?

14
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:40,480
Sit.

15
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,200
Meng.

16
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,240
This is so fun.

17
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,160
Si, Xing.

18
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:49,520
Do I look elegant sitting like this?

19
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,480
What about this?

20
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,320
Yes.

21
00:00:56,920 --> 00:00:57,680
Based on last time's experience,

22
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:59,200
you'll look stiff sitting like that.

23
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,480
Last time I put my hands
on my knees.

24
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,240
I felt so awkward.

25
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,360
So how do we not look awkward?

26
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:03,880
Teach us.

27
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,080
Teach us, Si.

28
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,320
You two are just naturally relaxed.

29
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:07,960
I think she's the one
who looks unnatural.

30
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:09,400
Natural.

31
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,920
Last time I was sitting
all over the place.

32
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,400
Right?

33
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,520
You looked really natural. As soon
as I was next to her, I was like this.

34
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:15,960
Si is so cute.

35
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:16,520
When it cuts to you...

36
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:17,160
I sit up straight.

37
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:17,740
Especially when you said,

38
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:19,760
"It's a fairy, not a dragonfly."

39
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,480
Welcome to the watch-along.

40
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,560
Welcome.

41
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,360
This is our second time
doing the watch-along.

42
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:28,840
Yeah.

43
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,760
Mine too.

44
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,000
Hers too.

45
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,520
(Second time)
Welcome, Xing.

46
00:01:32,540 --> 00:01:34,280
(Watch-along newbie arrives)

47
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,240
Let's introduce ourselves.

48
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:37,040
Hello everyone.

49
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:38,640
I'm Sun Qimeng

50
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,240
(Sun Qimeng)
from Heart Signal 9.

51
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,280
Hello everyone.

52
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:43,120
I'm Sha Yue'er

53
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,560
(Sha Yue'er)
from Heart Signal 9.

54
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,200
Hello everyone,

55
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,440
I'm Wu Xingying

56
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,200
(Wu Xingying)
from Heart Signal 9.

57
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:49,840
Hello everyone,

58
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,760
I'm Wu Siying

59
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,720
(Wu Siying)
from Heart Signal 9.

60
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,780
Meng, what was the last
watch-along you did?

61
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:58,500
(Curious)

62
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,520
It was the one at the playground.

63
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,360
The open day.

64
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,520
It was pretty touching.

65
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,360
You didn't cry during
the watch-along, did you?

66
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,400
How did you know?

67
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,600
You know me too well.

68
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:13,920
But I'm really looking forward
to today's episode.

69
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,400
I watched the previous episode.

70
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,520
So I roughly know
what's coming this time.

71
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:18,920
There'll be a double selection.

72
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:21,080
Yeah, it's the double-selection date.

73
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:22,760
Are you thirsty?

74
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,320
We can drink some water.

75
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,440
(Enjoy the food first)
Yeah.

76
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,840
We can eat, drink,
and watch at the same time.

77
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,080
I'll have this first.

78
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,200
I'm starving.

79
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,360
Didn't you eat earlier?

80
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,320
I did.

81
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:35,940
I'm just someone who gets hungry easily.

82
00:02:35,950 --> 00:02:38,560
My mom always asks
why I look like I haven't eaten.

83
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:41,800
Does your mom always follow the show?

84
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,920
Do your parents watch it too?

85
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,320
She already finished today's episode.

86
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:48,160
Are both your moms the emotional type?

87
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:48,960
Very emotional.

88
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,600
She said she laughed and cried today.

89
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,640
When she saw Xing smiling,

90
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,480
and then saw me go find her,

91
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,440
she started crying.

92
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,640
There's no way we're going

93
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,680
to finish this whole plate

94
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,320
before we start watching.

95
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,640
This might be the most
food-filled watch-along.

96
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,600
Then we'll finish everything.

97
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,480
This episode got stuck
with the four of us.

98
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:07,960
Too bad for it.

99
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,840
This is how you are, Xing?

100
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,560
She's honestly funny sometimes.

101
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:18,600
How about we...

102
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:19,760
Let's get started.

103
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,240
I'm so excited.

104
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:23,880
Let's start.

105
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:26,600
We're back.

106
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,960
This is after we came back
from that event.

107
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:29,480
Yeah.

108
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,070
You look like a greeter.

109
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,320
Our returning group

110
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,080
(Your hands...)
is way too big.

111
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:33,620
(Imitating)
Put them here.

112
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:34,320
You understood that?

113
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:35,190
I didn't understand you.

114
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:36,000
(Glances)
You didn't reply.

115
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:36,700
Why didn't I reply?

116
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:40,620
How much water temperature do you drink?

117
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:42,720
I can adjust it for you.

118
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:43,960
You're so thoughtful.

119
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:46,300
(Cup not opened)

120
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,070
Still half asleep.

121
00:03:47,590 --> 00:03:49,560
I might need to add some cold water.

122
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,000
Be careful.

123
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,880
(The water is hot)
Why is my voice like this?

124
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:53,120
(You first)
You sound like you're rapping.

125
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:54,580
I've finished getting water.

126
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,920
(Chen Hewen)
I'm done. Shall we go?

127
00:03:57,930 --> 00:03:59,800
I noticed you've become more thoughtful.

128
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:01,360
No, I mean,

129
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,840
Zhao Xilun is really obsessed

130
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,800
with turmeric powder.

131
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,960
Like, from the very beginning...

132
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,800
He was into health and wellness stuff.

133
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,480
Yeah, like anti-inflammatory powders.

134
00:04:13,170 --> 00:04:13,790
See you.

135
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,050
See you, guys.

136
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,880
Why is he speaking English again?

137
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:22,070
Just make it warm enough to drink.

138
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:25,040
400ml at 85 degrees,

139
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,900
plus

140
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:27,690
100ml at 25 degrees.

141
00:04:27,690 --> 00:04:28,800
That'll be over 70 degrees.

142
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,560
Up to you.

143
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,560
You two are the English group.

144
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,190
I saw there are individual ones.

145
00:04:35,190 --> 00:04:35,790
Try one.

146
00:04:37,140 --> 00:04:38,220
(Searching)

147
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:38,800
It's gone.

148
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,170
Guess what I'm doing.

149
00:04:42,170 --> 00:04:43,240
What's in your hand?

150
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,480
(Let me see)
You're looking for food.

151
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,640
I went to get ice cream.

152
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:51,260
(Walking away)

153
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,720
We're so sad.

154
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:55,720
Really so sad.

155
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,840
Come here, Meng.

156
00:04:58,140 --> 00:04:59,940
(Leaving the kitchen)

157
00:05:04,740 --> 00:05:06,500
(Wiping tears)

158
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:07,800
Don't cry.

159
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,200
I'm okay now.

160
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,400
Are you okay now?

161
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,160
(Sniffling)
Yeah, I'm okay now.

162
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:22,320
But your eyes look watery.

163
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:24,360
I'm better now, actually.

164
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:26,120
It's just that at that time,

165
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,000
because it

166
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,200
was that playground day.

167
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,800
Everyone probably
saw things differently.

168
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,320
Yeah.

169
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,440
From my perspective,

170
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,480
I just felt

171
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:36,920
like everyone seemed to

172
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,720
have someone else.

173
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,560
And at that time, I felt like I

174
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,760
was the extra person.

175
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:42,440
Then I was scared

176
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:43,080
that I might bother

177
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:43,600
you guys.

178
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,200
No.

179
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,720
How could you?

180
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,880
I really had that thought back then.

181
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:51,160
So I felt a little upset.

182
00:05:52,290 --> 00:05:54,800
But later I realized it
was actually okay.

183
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,240
Today, I told myself

184
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,720
I absolutely won't shed a single tear.

185
00:06:01,380 --> 00:06:02,470
(Trying to calm down)

186
00:06:02,470 --> 00:06:03,350
Okay.

187
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:07,220
Do you want to talk about it?

188
00:06:07,220 --> 00:06:08,100
Or

189
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,490
you can just sit here and eat for a bit?

190
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,520
I'll sit here and eat for a bit, okay?

191
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:11,970
Okay.

192
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,520
(Don't tell anyone)
I need to roast myself for a second.

193
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,320
I look so ugly when I cry, guys.

194
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,280
I was about to say you looked beautiful.

195
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:18,760
You looked good!

196
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,080
Yeah.

197
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,640
Then I looked at myself back then.

198
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,960
I cried like a zongzi.

199
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,880
I really looked like that!

200
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,440
Like a zongzi!

201
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:26,120
Really.

202
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:28,440
Why did all my facial features
bunch together?

203
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,800
You're super cute, okay?

204
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,960
It's okay. Keep going.

205
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:35,150
Two.

206
00:06:35,860 --> 00:06:36,720
Do I have to give them?

207
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,320
Sun Bohan is pretty relaxed too.

208
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:40,680
Right? The way he sits

209
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,040
is so funny!

210
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,040
Yeah.

211
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,040
Yeah, Sun Bohan.

212
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,720
He's really relaxed.

213
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,960
He has that old money vibe.

214
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,320
Old money vibe!

215
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,880
No, it's so funny!

216
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,010
Do you have two people you want
to give them to?

217
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:54,810
Let's see.

218
00:06:55,290 --> 00:06:57,050
I'm curious who Chen Hewen will give his to.

219
00:06:57,810 --> 00:06:58,790
He'll definitely give one to you.

220
00:06:58,790 --> 00:06:59,430
Who else?

221
00:06:59,430 --> 00:07:00,040
(Who else?)

222
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,360
My gosh.

223
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:03,000
Did you expect him
to give one to you back then?

224
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,200
I think I was a little angry then.

225
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,560
Because of that daytime activity.

226
00:07:09,290 --> 00:07:10,340
I'll just write a name.

227
00:07:12,380 --> 00:07:13,400
Can't make her wait too long.

228
00:07:14,290 --> 00:07:15,040
Oh my God.

229
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,240
That's how Cao Yiheng is?

230
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,800
Yeah, Cao Yiheng is really sweet.

231
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,680
Yeah.

232
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:23,160
They said Yu Yang has "husband energy".

233
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,720
There are guys outside all three dorms.

234
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,570
Is it Cao Yiheng?

235
00:07:34,570 --> 00:07:35,130
No way.

236
00:07:35,130 --> 00:07:36,220
I can't go out right now.

237
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:37,500
I'll open the door.

238
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:39,990
She said she can't come out right now.

239
00:07:39,990 --> 00:07:41,360
She can't come out?

240
00:07:41,870 --> 00:07:42,690
It really is Cao Yiheng.

241
00:07:42,690 --> 00:07:43,310
I'm coming.

242
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:45,150
What is this?

243
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,630
That instant change of expression!

244
00:07:46,630 --> 00:07:47,380
Wait.

245
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,880
The expression change was way too fast.

246
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,080
Cui Kaiyi.

247
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,640
That's hilarious.

248
00:07:54,530 --> 00:07:55,460
Will you write my name?

249
00:07:55,460 --> 00:07:56,460
(Glances)

250
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:58,500
Isn't that an obvious question?

251
00:07:58,500 --> 00:07:59,070
You're testing me?

252
00:07:59,070 --> 00:07:59,800
Of course I will.

253
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:01,360
These two are so funny.

254
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,760
(Handing over)
They gave one.

255
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:06,800
I remember Cui Kaiyi gave two.

256
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,280
The other one was for Zhao Xilun.

257
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:10,160
Because she knew Zhao Xilun
wouldn't give one to her.

258
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,040
She thought she had to give out two.

259
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,920
To two guys.

260
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,240
Yeah.

261
00:08:14,030 --> 00:08:14,630
Come on.

262
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:16,830
Where do you want to go?

263
00:08:17,650 --> 00:08:19,420
I want to go...

264
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:21,620
(Into your heart)

265
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,200
Oh my God.

266
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,520
(Yu Yang, Liang Renfang)
Yu Yang has this side too?

267
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,320
Never seen it before.

268
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:25,960
I've never seen it.

269
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,320
Me neither.

270
00:08:27,740 --> 00:08:28,510
Oh my God.

271
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:30,820
Look.

272
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:32,659
Everyone gets two date tickets.

273
00:08:32,659 --> 00:08:33,679
For two separate dates.

274
00:08:34,539 --> 00:08:36,070
But it never said you
had to write two people,

275
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:36,580
right?

276
00:08:36,950 --> 00:08:37,809
Zhao Xilun and I

277
00:08:37,809 --> 00:08:39,210
totally misunderstood it.

278
00:08:39,230 --> 00:08:40,760
(We thought we had to write two names)
He wrote Si's name.

279
00:08:42,270 --> 00:08:42,620
Yeah.

280
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,720
I see.

281
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,500
(Then I'll cross it out)
Sun Bohan gives such a sense of security.

282
00:08:45,500 --> 00:08:45,960
(Laughs)

283
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,580
I thought it'd be weird
to write someone else.

284
